## Example Usage

Declare the provider with the source `tambo-ai/railway-iac-sdk`. Its resources are named `railway_service`, `railway_volume`, and so on.

```terraform
terraform {
  required_providers {
    railway = {
      source = "tambo-ai/railway-iac-sdk"
    }
  }
}
```

